ort-repair/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:11:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"request-ruling\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The latest verifier result has one blocking finding and explicitly requires a human ruling before story acceptance. The conflict is between AC-4.7/TC-4.7 requiring turn/chunk reads to return form states and the implemented deviation that exposes those states through turns.report instead.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"decisionType\\\":\\\"requirements-scope-ruling\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Does exposing turn and chunk form states through turns.report satisfy AC-4.7 for this story, or must turn/chunk read surfaces attach form states directly?\\\",\\\"defaultRecommendation\\\":\\\"Require AC-4.7 as written unless the story owner explicitly accepts the recorded deviation. Without that ruling, do not accept the story.\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Verifier finding SV-04-001 in /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/04-derivation-state-report-repair/004-verify.json states AC-4.7 and TC-4.7 remain unverified.\\\",\\\"Story AC-4.7 says reading a message, turn, or chunk whose forms are not ready returns the record with form states and no errors.\\\",\\\"Implementation deviation says TurnRecord does not gain a forms key; turn/chunk form states surface through turns.report instead.\\\",\\\"Gates passed: pnpm vitest run test/report-repair.test.ts, pnpm run green-verify, and pnpm run verify-all.\\\"],\\\"allowedResponses\\\":[\\\"Accept the deviation: turns.report is the state attachment surface for turn/chunk forms under AC-4.7.\\\",\\\"Reject the deviation: implement direct form-state attachment on turn/chunk read surfaces before acceptance.\\\"]}}\"}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/04-derivation-state-report-repair/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:15:{\"type\":\