s through turns.report satisfy AC-4.7 for this story, or must turn/chunk read surfaces attach form states directly?\",\"defaultRecommendation\":\"Require AC-4.7 as written unless the story owner explicitly accepts the recorded deviation. Without that ruling, do not accept the story.\",\"evidence\":[\"Verifier finding SV-04-001 in /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/04-derivation-state-report-repair/004-verify.json states AC-4.7 and TC-4.7 remain unverified.\",\"Story AC-4.7 says reading a message, turn, or chunk whose forms are not ready returns the record with form states and no errors.\",\"Implementation deviation says TurnRecord does not gain a forms key; turn/chunk form states surface through turns.report instead.\",\"Gates passed: pnpm vitest run test/report-repair.test.ts, pnpm run green-verify, and pnpm run verify-all.\"],\"allowedResponses\":[\"Accept the deviation: turns.report is the state attachment surface for turn/chunk forms under AC-4.7.\",\"Reject the deviation: implement direct form-state attachment on turn/chunk read surfaces before acceptance.\"]},\"recommendedImplLeadAction\":\"ask-ruling\"},\"startedFromPrimitiveArtifacts\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/04-derivation-state-report-repair/001-story-validate.json\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"story-run-current\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/04-derivation-state-report-repair/story-lead/001-current.json\"},{\"kind\":\"story-run-events\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/04-derivation-state-report-repair/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\"},{\"kind\":\"story-run-final-package\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-co